<!--
  The handful of measurements that are not the same in the dark.

  Sizes never change between themes — a 96dp mark is 96dp whatever the ground. Opacities do: the same
  4% wash that reads as texture over white is invisible over ink, so the splash's ornaments are lifted
  to the strength the dark canvas draws them at.
-->
<resources>

    <item name="ds_splash_ornament_alpha" format="float" type="dimen">0.07</item>

</resources>
